# Deploy to main

After completing a feature or fix that the user asked for, always:

1. Build to verify
2. Commit relevant files
3. Push immediately to `main` (`git push -u origin HEAD`)

Do not wait for a separate "commit/push" request unless the user explicitly says not to push.
Do not open a PR for routine game updates — ship on `main`.
